SUMMARY:Live Music with Steven Courtney Band at Cherry Crest Adventure Farm
DESCRIPTION:Check out our amazing lineup of musicians that will be performi
 ng live right here at the farm! Join us on select Friday evenings and Satu
 rdays for toe-tapping tunes from our favorite bands. Steven Courtney Band 
 is an American heartland folk-rock band from Manheim\, PA\, fronted by sin
 ger/songwriter/producer Steven Courtney. Across 30+ years of writing\, per
 forming\, and recording\, Courtney has delivered a steady stream of roots\
 , folk\, rock\, and blues—becoming a beloved public figure and respected
  musician throughout Central Pennsylvania and beyond. Additional Fun Thing
